  "details": "For a few weeks now there has been a bug where suddenly you can see their custom shaders even though they are not shown.\nI have no idea on how to reproduce this, but I have encountered it a few times now.\nI double checked as well if I had them shown and I did not. \nFriends of mine have encountered this bug as well and random players I was hanging out with.",
